{"route":"/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design","city":"pitampura","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Modern Interior Design in Pitampura | 9th Corner","description":"Modern interior design in Pitampura by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Modern Interior Design in Pitampura | 9th Corner","description":"Modern interior design in Pitampura by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Modern Interior Design in Pitampura | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"Modern interior design in Pitampura by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","keywords":"Modern Interior Design in Hauz Khas, Best modern interior designers in Hauz Khas, Contemporary interior designers in Hauz Khas, Affordable modern interior design in Hauz Khas, Minimalistic interior design in Hauz Khas, Modern home interior designers in Hauz Khas, Modern 2BHK interior design Hauz Khas, Modern 3BHK interior design Hauz Khas, Luxury modern interior design Hauz Khas, Modern apartment interior designers in Hauz Khas, Modern commercial interior designers in Hauz Khas, Modern office interior design in Hauz Khas, Modern modular kitchen designs in Hauz Khas, Modern living room interior design Hauz Khas, Contemporary home decor Hauz Khas, Modern interior decorators in Hauz Khas, Turnkey modern interior design services in Hauz Khas,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"Modern interior design is all about simplicity, elegance, and functionality. At our firm, we specialize in creating contemporary spaces in Hauz Khas that are stylish, comfortable, and tailored to your lifestyle. Our modern interiors blend clean lines\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Pitampura\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Pitampura\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Modern Interior Design in Hauz Khas\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is modern interior design for a Pitampura home?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clean lines, an open layout, neutral colours and practical furniture. It suits builder floors, where it makes rooms feel more spacious.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a modern home include a puja room?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A puja room can be designed in a simple, modern style with good lighting and storage, so it fits the rest of the home.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is modern design good for offices too?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Simple layouts, good lighting and durable modern finishes work well for offices, clinics and showrooms.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you add warmth to modern interior design?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wood, fabric, warm lighting and a few personal pieces keep a modern home from feeling cold.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Modern Interior Design in Pitampura, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Modern Interior Design\",\"description\":\"Modern interior design in Pitampura by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Pitampura, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/e2.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Modern Interior Design in Pitampura, Delhi</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Modern Makeovers for Pitampura Homes</h2>\n            <p>Our modern interior design services in Pitampura, Delhi prioritize the art of simplicity, elegance, and high-performance functionality. We craft interiors characterized by clean architectural lines, sophisticated neutral palettes, and avant-garde contemporary furniture—creating spaces that feel expansive, organized, and visually serene even in the heart of North Delhi’s urban landscape.</p>\n            <p>Many Pitampura homes still have heavy wooden almirahs, dark panelling and busy ceilings from the 1990s. Owners rebuilding or renovating often want a lighter, cleaner feel. Modern interior design offers that: simple lines, practical storage, good lighting and a calm palette that suits both young couples and older parents.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Balancing Style with Practicality</h2>\n            <p>\"We design homes, corporate offices, and retail spaces that fuse high-end aesthetic appeal with effortless everyday usability. From intelligent spatial flow and ergonomic furniture to automated lighting and curated décor, every element is precision-engineered to create a cohesive, modern environment tailored specifically to your needs.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Updating Older Homes</h3>\n                <p>We replace bulky wardrobes with sleek built-ins, open up dark corridors, swap heavy grills for clean frames and simplify ceilings. Floors can be refreshed with large tiles or wooden finishes. The result keeps the home's solid structure while giving it a fresh, current look.</p><p>Old wooden furniture with sentimental value can be refinished to suit the new style.</p><p>Grills on windows and balconies can be replaced with slim, safe frames that let in more light.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>New Rebuilt Floors</h3>\n                <p>For new floors, modern interior design starts from scratch: open living and dining spaces, a handle-free kitchen, bedrooms with built-in storage and bathrooms with clean, frameless fittings. A neutral base with a few bold accents keeps the look fresh for years.</p><p>Lighting is planned in layers from the start, with dimmers in living rooms and warm light in bedrooms.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Modern, but Made for Family Life</h3>\n                <p>A modern home should still suit a joint family. We plan enough seating for visitors, a proper puja space with a clean design, kitchen storage for daily cooking and wardrobes that hold more than they seem to. Matte finishes and easy-care surfaces cope with daily use. Warm wood tones and soft lighting keep the home welcoming.</p><p><b>Minimalist Mastery:</b> Creating layouts that achieve maximum impact through intentional negative space and a \"less is more\" architectural approach.</p><p><b>Material Innovation:</b> Expert application of industrial-sleek materials—glass, polished concrete, and brushed metals—integrated with warm natural textures for a balanced feel.</p><p><b>Ergonomic Intelligence:</b> Modern interior design with the human body in mind, ensuring that every modern piece of furniture and fixture supports health, comfort, and productivity.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>From Old to New</h3>\n                <p>We usually begin with what you want to remove: the heavy panelling, the cluttered ceiling, the almirah that blocks the window. Once that list is clear, our modern interior design team proposes a simpler plan, a short list of materials and 3D views the whole family can look at together.</p><p>Work on site is supervised daily, and every line and joint is checked before handover.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Modern Interior Design That Suits Every Generation</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Moving from a traditional to a modern look can be a big change for a family. We help everyone agree on a style that feels right for all generations. Parents and children both see the 3D views before anything is built.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Masters of Contemporary Design Principles and Urban Minimalism</strong>\n                    A clear grasp of current design and city living.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Solutions Across Residential, Office, and Retail Sectors</strong>\n                    Modern solutions across homes, offices and shops.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Professional End-to-End Project Handling with Turnkey Precision</strong>\n                    Turnkey handling with careful finishing.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Old Furniture Reused</strong>\n                    Pieces you love refinished to fit the new look.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Style Every Generation Likes</strong>\n                    Clean design that still feels warm and familiar.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to inhabit the future? Partner with Pitampura’s premier modern design specialists to build a space that transcends time.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects Near Pitampura</h2>\n                <p>Homes we have refreshed in Ashok Vihar and Gujranwala Town.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-arun-ashok-vihar/mr-arun-ashok-vihar/5.avif\" alt=\"Bedroom design in Ashok Vihar, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Ashok Vihar Bedroom\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/dr-ak-jain-model-town/dr-ak-jain-model-town/52.avif\" alt=\"Home in Model Town, Delhi designed by 9th Corner\" title=\"Model Town Home\">\n                            </div>\n                        </d