       <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Fresh Start for Your Home</h2>\n            <p>A lighter, simpler home can change how your family feels every day. Thoughtful modern interior design makes that change smooth and lasting.</p><p>Ready to modernise your Pitampura home? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Call 9th Corner</a> to begin.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}